Write a min-stack that returns the minimum in O(1).

```python
class MinStack:
    def __init__(self):
        self.items = []
        self.mins = []
    def push(self, x):
        self.items.append(x)
        self.mins.append(x if not self.mins else min(x, self.mins[-1]))
    def pop(self):
        self.mins.pop()
        return self.items.pop()
    def minimum(self):
        return self.mins[-1]

