from functools import lru_cache

@lru_cache(maxsize=None)
def memoized_fib(n):
    if n < 2:
        return n
    return memoized_fib(n - 1) + memoized_fib(n - 2)
```

`lru_cache` remembers earlier results, turning the exponential naive recursion into linear time. Very large n will still hit the recursion limit.

